{"id":"bc531a0de01eb1c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-ran.md","title":"Range","display":"df-ran — Range","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ran","aliases":["58-df-ran","Range","Image"],"display":"df-ran — Range","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ran"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ran</span><span>Range</span><span>Image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ran — Range"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbf V\">\\(f\\in\\mathbf V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ran:V\\to V\">\\(\\ran:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ran}\\vdash\\ran(f)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup f:\\exists x\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ran}\\vdash\\ran(f)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup f:\\exists x\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Range: set of all output values</li>\n<li>For a function graph, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[A]=\\{y:\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}\">\\(f[A]=\\{y:\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]=\\{x:\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]=\\{x:\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Kernel and null-space language applies only after algebraic structure has been supplied.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\ran:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ran}\\vdash\\ran(f)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup f:\\exists x\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"f[A]=\\{y:\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[B]=\\{x:\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":754,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1033","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ran.md|58-df-ran]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":[]}